{"script":"wt_c4_09_1","exps":[{"para":{"tag":"tag_1"},"key":"tag"},{"para":{"layer":"chara2"},"key":"top"},{"para":{"noIn":false,"mirrow":false,"alpha":0,"scaleX":1,"addImg":"chara004_1_face_chara004_1e","layer":"chara2","noOut":false,"x":410,"scaleY":1,"trans":true,"bright":1,"y":-204,"img":"chara004_1"},"key":"setLayer"},{"para":{"noIn":false,"mirrow":false,"alpha":1,"scaleX":1,"addImg":"chara004_1_face_chara004_1e","layer":"chara2","noOut":false,"x":410,"transTime":300,"scaleY":1,"trans":true,"bright":1,"y":-204,"img":"chara004_1"},"key":"moveLayer"},{"para":{"time":300},"key":"wait"},{"para":{"nameSide":"left","charaName":"契约官艾尔莎","text":"[show]呀！非常感谢两位！垂死菌林的邪恶蕈人已经被驱赶了！[l][cm]"},"key":"text"},{"para":{"tag":"tag_5"},"key":"tag"},{"para":{"img":"chara004_1_face_chara004_1a","layer":"chara2"},"key":"setLayerFace"},{"para":{"nameSide":"left","charaName":"契约官艾尔莎","text":"[show]那些蕈人表面上没什么威胁，不过一旦聚集成群之后造成的破坏力不可小觑。而你们成功在情况恶化之前阻止了它们。[l][cm]"},"key":"text"},{"para":{"tag":"tag_4"},"key":"tag"},{"para":{"nameSide":"left","charaName":"契约官艾尔莎","text":"[show]你们的付出不但改善了黑森林的处境，还改善了驿站和黑森林的关系。[l][cm]"},"key":"text"},{"para":{"tag":"tag_3"},"key":"tag"},{"para":{"nameSide":"left","charaName":"契约官艾尔莎","text":"[show]过去封闭的他们很多事情都难以处理，但在得到驿站和契约者的帮助后，他们的麻烦少了很多。[l][cm]"},"key":"text"},{"para":{"tag":"tag_6"},"key":"tag"},{"para":{"nameSide":"left","charaName":"契约官艾尔莎","text":"[show]我想驿站和黑森林的关系会越来越紧密，到那时候大家一定能达成更好的合作，进而走向更好的未来。[l][cm]"},"key":"text"},{"para":{"tag":"tag_2"},"key":"tag"},{"para":{"noIn":false,"mirrow":false,"alpha":0,"scaleX":1,"addImg":"chara004_1_face_chara004_1a","layer":"chara2","noOut":false,"x":410,"transTime":300,"scaleY":1,"trans":true,"bright":1,"y":-204,"img":"chara004_1"},"key":"moveLayer"},{"para":{"time":300},"key":"wait"},{"para":{"end":true},"key":"end"}],"des":"紧急契约：垂死菌林"}